ledger-db   ✗ dies with us-east-1a

  Cause: PersistentVolume pvc-8f21ac is zonal (nodeAffinity -> us-east-1a). The pod cannot run anywhere else. No manifest change moves it.

  This is an architecture change, not a patch:
  replicate at the data layer, move to regional storage, or accept the risk
  and document it.

